  "reason": "In the #129 rerun on 2026-10-23 (candidate-002 after amendment 001), 145/145 bundles and 127/129 products passed, and the 2 failures (legacy100-0046 and legacy100-0077) came from a timing race in the frozen reference test \"create > sends the required fields and opens the new row\" (reference/src/app.test.tsx:138): after Save, the detail page heading <Name> 5 renders as soon as the page mounts, while the detail GET starts later in a passive useEffect. findByRole(\"heading\") could therefore resolve before the GET was recorded in calls[1], producing expected undefined to be '/api<path>/5'. In reference/src/app.test.tsx, the assertion on calls[1] now waits for the detail GET using waitFor from @testing-library/react: await waitFor(() => expect(calls[1]?.url).toBe(`/api${RESOURCE.path}/5`)).",
